  "raw_response": "```python\ndef solve(grid):\n    n = 9\n    # Find the 3x3 block containing the pattern\n    # Extract pattern position\n    cells = [(r,c) for r in range(n) for c in range(n) if grid[r][c] != 0]\n    min_r = min(r for r,c in cells)\n    min_c = min(c for r,c in cells)\n    block_r = min_r // 3\n    block_c = min_c // 3\n    \n    # Extract 3x3 pattern\n    pattern = [[grid[block_r*3+i][block_c*3+j] for j in range(3)] for i in range(3)]\n    \n    out = [[0]*n for _ in range(n)]\n    \n    # Place pattern at diagonal offsets\n    for d in range(-2, 3):\n        br = block_r + d\n        bc = block_c + d\n        if 0 <= br < 3 and 0 <= bc < 3:\n            for i in range(3):\n                for j in range(3):\n                    out[br*3+i][bc*3+j] = pattern[i][j]\n    \n    return out\n```",
  "script": "def solve(grid):\n    n = 9\n    # Find the 3x3 block containing the pattern\n    # Extract pattern position\n    cells = [(r,c) for r in range(n) for c in range(n) if grid[r][c] != 0]\n    min_r = min(r for r,c in cells)\n    min_c = min(c for r,c in cells)\n    block_r = min_r // 3\n    block_c = min_c // 3\n    \n    # Extract 3x3 pattern\n    pattern = [[grid[block_r*3+i][block_c*3+j] for j in range(3)] for i in range(3)]\n    \n    out = [[0]*n for _ in range(n)]\n    \n    # Place pattern at diagonal offsets\n    for d in range(-2, 3):\n        br = block_r + d\n        bc = block_c + d\n        if 0 <= br < 3 and 0 <= bc < 3:\n            for i in range(3):\n                for j in range(3):\n                    out[br*3+i][bc*3+j] = pattern[i][j]\n    \n    return out",
